    <img class="canva-image" id="lightbox-image" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5651879/pexels-photo-5651879.jpeg" alt="Elegant woman in a coat poses in a greenhouse setting, capturing a serene sunset moment."> <span class="lightbox-caption canva-text" id="lightbox-caption"></span>
